From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leon Zandman <leon@wirwar.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:18:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] 9964: Use model rows for Delete/Merge Blocks and Find All
 results when the table is filtered

When the Memory Map or the Find All results table is filtered, some actions use the selected view rows as model rows. They then act on the row at the same position in the unfiltered list instead of the selected row.
